  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 只有2000块去陌生城市闯荡的女孩，后来怎样了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671e76b344ae79002c780964</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671e76b344ae79002c780964</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>录这期播客的时候，我自己一个人坐在阳台上，聊了一个半小时。没有脚本和大纲，只有主题就开始聊了起来。一路回忆着当时的点点滴滴，还是蛮感慨的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案就不多写了，内容都在播客里了，贴几张当时的图片吧，愿我们无论身处何时何地，都能找到热爱，好好生活，共勉，加油！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-X-UDOndqdCyeCiPIZ_KCJNRVz.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtQAl3mUKDVYwkIGN6NYRV8bfZ_B.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAfL7NpVBZBCOwH-uRSpjW3PYhI.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJX4k0caX2gftYiCPPK380Bq0H6.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkufaAckd6w3UTq4Q_Nf2Mh-BCh-.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvxSpfAqtmNtLHpVFr3miU11Btq_.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpBIEHDFGoeA7QBFaxA8Xu4cy_hN.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhXno1IX8Iwu_CcOdFrXGcktm-u.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2bGo57ZEnPLntvkwkYlZGO4U0K.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJhTgsn1i8huKbgYTl8RH51RSVZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAlXO9wSUSjWvyykwKYbKLj9YHr.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqjfue7Ikdctjj1_Do6y5trBfBwx.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbBu-AK_txujPGjhFRb0ZygOIfq.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft6WU92thcXJbA5T4savsJT-JMrA.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_PG0dTD2D7gt-j0N7oxNV5IrU9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmqWgwAzJhoeIT3TEXFtAZu-4gwK.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOUJNAVBjk-KmL_tL_gJHb3-1tc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnud0Di50q0H0C3xWMyNQ7KChYJv.JPG"></figure><span></span>